INSERT INTO `activities` VALUES (1,NULL,'Meditation Tour','meditation-tour','ri-flower-line','Find inner peace in mountain monasteries and sacred sites','Embark on a spiritual journey through Nepal\'s most sacred sites. Visit ancient monasteries, participate in meditation sessions led by Buddhist monks, and experience the profound tranquility of the Himalayas. This tour combines spiritual practice with cultural immersion, offering a unique opportunity to disconnect from the modern world and reconnect with your inner self.','3-7 days','easy',250.00,'USD','Year-round',1,10,'[\"Visit sacred Buddhist monasteries\", \"Guided meditation sessions\", \"Meet with Buddhist monks\", \"Explore spiritual sites\", \"Learn mindfulness techniques\", \"Peaceful mountain settings\"]','[\"Experienced spiritual guide\", \"Monastery visits\", \"Meditation sessions\", \"Accommodation\", \"Meals during tour\", \"Transportation\"]','[\"Personal expenses\", \"Tips\", \"Travel insurance\"]','Open mind and willingness to learn','Kathmandu Valley & Surrounding Areas',1,1,1,'Meditation Tour in Nepal - Inner Peace & Spiritual Journey','Experience deep meditation and spiritual awakening in Nepal\'s sacred monasteries. Guided tours with Buddhist monks.','2025-12-04 14:43:34','2025-12-04 14:43:34'),(2,NULL,'Mountain Cycling','mountain-cycling','ri-bike-line','Ride through scenic mountain trails and villages','Experience the thrill of mountain biking through Nepal\'s diverse landscapes. From challenging mountain passes to gentle village trails, this activity offers routes for all skill levels. Ride through traditional villages, terraced farmlands, and forests while enjoying spectacular mountain views. Our experienced guides ensure safety while you explore some of the best cycling routes in the Himalayas.','1-7 days','moderate',150.00,'USD','March-May, September-November',2,15,'[\"Scenic mountain trails\", \"Traditional village visits\", \"Professional guide\", \"Quality mountain bikes\", \"Safety equipment\", \"Flexible routes\"]','[\"Mountain bike rental\", \"Safety gear\", \"Professional guide\", \"Support vehicle\", \"Snacks and water\", \"Basic bike maintenance\"]','[\"Personal cycling gear\", \"Travel insurance\", \"Meals\", \"Accommodation\"]','Basic cycling experience, good physical fitness','Kathmandu Valley, Pokhara, Nagarkot',1,1,2,'Mountain Cycling in Nepal - Himalayan Bike Tours','Explore Nepal on two wheels! Mountain biking tours through scenic trails, villages, and mountain passes.','2025-12-04 14:43:34','2025-12-04 14:43:34'),(3,NULL,'Hiking','hiking','ri-walk-line','Explore beautiful trails suitable for all fitness levels','Discover Nepal\'s natural beauty through our curated hiking routes. Whether you\'re a beginner or experienced hiker, we offer trails that showcase stunning landscapes, traditional villages, and breathtaking mountain views. Our day hikes and multi-day excursions are perfect for those who want to experience the Himalayas without committing to a full trek.','Half-day to 5 days','easy',50.00,'USD','Year-round (best in Spring & Autumn)',1,20,'[\"Suitable for beginners\", \"Stunning mountain views\", \"Village encounters\", \"Nature photography opportunities\", \"Flexible itineraries\", \"Expert local guides\"]','[\"Professional guide\", \"Permits if required\", \"First aid kit\", \"Basic snacks and water\"]','[\"Meals\", \"Accommodation\", \"Personal gear\", \"Travel insurance\"]','Comfortable walking shoes, basic fitness','Kathmandu Valley, Pokhara, Nagarkot, Dhulikhel',1,1,3,'Hiking in Nepal - Day Hikes & Nature Walks','Experience Nepal\'s beauty through guided hiking tours. Trails for all fitness levels with stunning Himalayan views.','2025-12-04 14:43:34','2025-12-04 14:43:34'),(4,NULL,'Jungle Safari','jungle-safari','ri-bus-line','Encounter wildlife in pristine national parks','Venture into Nepal\'s lowland jungles for an unforgettable wildlife experience. Chitwan and Bardia National Parks offer opportunities to spot one-horned rhinos, Bengal tigers, elephants, and hundreds of bird species. Activities include jeep safaris, jungle walks, canoe rides, and visits to elephant breeding centers. Experience the rich biodiversity of the Terai region.','2-4 days','easy',350.00,'USD','October-March (dry season)',2,10,'[\"One-horned rhino sightings\", \"Bengal tiger territory\", \"Elephant encounters\", \"Jeep safaris\", \"Canoe rides\", \"Bird watching\", \"Tharu cultural program\"]','[\"National park entrance fee\", \"Accommodation in jungle lodge\", \"All meals\", \"Jeep safari\", \"Nature walks\", \"Canoe ride\", \"Professional naturalist guide\"]','[\"Travel to/from national park\", \"Tips\", \"Personal expenses\", \"Travel insurance\"]','No special requirements, suitable for families','Chitwan National Park, Bardia National Park',1,1,4,'Jungle Safari Nepal - Chitwan & Bardia Wildlife Tours','Experience Nepal\'s wildlife! Jungle safaris in Chitwan and Bardia. Spot rhinos, tigers, and elephants in their natural habitat.','2025-12-04 14:43:34','2025-12-04 14:43:34'),(5,NULL,'One Day Hike','one-day-hike','ri-compass-3-line','Perfect day trips around Kathmandu valley','Escape the city for a day and explore the beautiful hills surrounding Kathmandu. Our one-day hikes are perfect for travelers with limited time. Popular destinations include Nagarkot for sunrise views, Shivapuri National Park for nature walks, and Champadevi Hill for panoramic views. These hikes offer a perfect blend of nature, culture, and stunning mountain vistas.','1 day (6-8 hours)','easy',40.00,'USD','Year-round',1,15,'[\"Sunrise/sunset views\", \"Close to Kathmandu\", \"No special equipment needed\", \"Mountain panoramas\", \"Local village interactions\", \"Perfect for beginners\"]','[\"Hotel pickup/drop-off\", \"Professional guide\", \"Transportation\", \"Basic refreshments\", \"National park entry (if applicable)\"]','[\"Lunch\", \"Personal expenses\", \"Tips\"]','Basic fitness, comfortable walking shoes','Nagarkot, Shivapuri, Champadevi, Phulchowki',1,1,5,'One Day Hike Near Kathmandu - Day Trip Adventures','Quick escape from Kathmandu! One-day hiking tours to Nagarkot, Shivapuri, and more. Perfect for busy travelers.','2025-12-04 14:43:34','2025-12-04 14:43:34'),(6,NULL,'Bungee Jumping','bungee-jumping','ri-parachute-line','Take the leap from Nepal\'s highest bungee platform','Experience the ultimate adrenaline rush with bungee jumping in Nepal! Located just 3 hours from Kathmandu, The Last Resort offers one of the highest bungee jumps in the world at 160 meters above the Bhote Koshi River. Safety is our top priority with certified instructors and international safety standards. This is a once-in-a-lifetime experience that will leave you with unforgettable memories and a sense of achievement.','Half day','extreme',100.00,'USD','October-April (best weather)',1,1,'[\"160-meter free fall\", \"Spectacular gorge location\", \"International safety standards\", \"Professional video/photos available\", \"Certificate of bravery\", \"Scenic location\"]','[\"Safety equipment\", \"Professional instructors\", \"Certificate\", \"Free refreshments\", \"Transportation from Kathmandu available\"]','[\"Transportation (can be arranged)\", \"Video/photos package\", \"Meals\", \"Travel insurance (mandatory)\"]','Age 13+, weight 40-120 kg, medical fitness required','The Last Resort, Bhote Koshi River',1,1,6,'Bungee Jumping Nepal - The Last Resort Adventure','Take the leap! Experience Nepal\'s highest bungee jump at 160 meters. Safe, thrilling, and unforgettable.','2025-12-04 14:43:34','2025-12-04 14:43:34'),(7,NULL,'Hot Air Balloon','hot-air-balloon','ri-flight-takeoff-line','Soar above the Himalayas with breathtaking aerial views','Float peacefully above the Kathmandu Valley or Pokhara as the sun rises over the Himalayas. Hot air ballooning offers a unique perspective of Nepal\'s stunning landscapes, terraced fields, and traditional villages. This serene experience combines adventure with tranquility, providing unmatched photo opportunities and a bird\'s-eye view of the world\'s highest mountains.','3-4 hours (including setup)','easy',200.00,'USD','October-March (clear skies)',1,10,'[\"Sunrise flight over Himalayas\", \"360-degree panoramic views\", \"Peaceful aerial experience\", \"Professional pilot\", \"Celebration champagne\", \"Flight certificate\"]','[\"Hot air balloon ride (1 hour)\", \"Safety briefing\", \"Professional pilot\", \"Transport to/from launch site\", \"Champagne celebration\", \"Flight certificate\"]','[\"Hotel pickup (can be arranged)\", \"Video/photos package\", \"Travel insurance\"]','Age 6+, reasonable fitness to climb into basket','Kathmandu Valley, Pokhara',1,1,7,'Hot Air Balloon Nepal - Himalayan Balloon Flight','Float above the Himalayas! Hot air balloon rides over Kathmandu and Pokhara with stunning mountain views.','2025-12-04 14:43:34','2025-12-04 14:43:34'),(8,NULL,'Mountain Flight','mountain-flight','ri-plane-line','Experience Everest up close from a scenic flight','Get up close to the world\'s highest peaks without trekking! Our mountain flights offer guaranteed window seats as you soar past Mount Everest, Lhotse, Makalu, and other Himalayan giants. This one-hour flight departs from Kathmandu and provides spectacular aerial views of snow-capped peaks, glaciers, and high-altitude landscapes. Perfect for those with limited time or physical constraints.','1 hour','easy',220.00,'USD','October-May (clear weather)',1,1,'[\"Close-up views of Mt. Everest\", \"Guaranteed window seat\", \"Professional pilot commentary\", \"Views of 20+ peaks\", \"Perfect for all ages\", \"Weather guarantee policy\"]','[\"Mountain flight (1 hour)\", \"Guaranteed window seat\", \"Flight certificate\", \"Airport transfers\", \"Pilot commentary\"]','[\"Video/photos package\", \"Travel insurance\"]','No special requirements, suitable for all ages','Kathmandu (Tribhuvan International Airport)',1,1,8,'Everest Mountain Flight - See Everest Without Trekking','See Everest without trekking! One-hour mountain flight with guaranteed window seats and views of 8,000m peaks.','2025-12-04 14:43:34','2025-12-04 14:43:34');
