ak. Photography and mountain appreciation.',5700,1,NULL,NULL,NULL),(344,47,11,'Makalu BC to Shershon','Begin the return descent.',4615,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(345,47,12,'Shershon to Nehe Kharka','Continue descent.',4328,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(346,47,13,'Nehe Kharka to Mumbuk','Return through the Barun Valley.',3550,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(347,47,14,'Mumbuk to Dobato','Continue descent.',3630,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(348,47,15,'Dobato to Tashigaon','Long descent to Tashigaon.',2070,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(349,47,16,'Tashigaon to Seduwa','Continue the return trek.',1500,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(350,47,17,'Seduwa to Num','Final day of trekking back to the airstrip area.',1560,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(351,47,18,'Fly Num/Tumlingtar to Kathmandu','Mountain flight back to Kathmandu.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(352,47,19,'Kathmandu Rest','Rest day.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(353,47,20,'Departure','Transfer to Tribhuvan International Airport.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(354,48,1,'Fly Kathmandu to Taplejung','Mountain flight to far-eastern Nepal gateway.',1819,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(355,48,2,'Taplejung to Chirwa','Begin trekking down through sub-tropical forest and terraced fields.',1270,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(356,48,3,'Chirwa to Lelep','Trek through traditional villages toward the high mountains.',1820,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(357,48,4,'Lelep to Yamphudin','Climb through diverse forest to Yamphudin, the last motor road point.',2080,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(358,48,5,'Yamphudin to Tortong','Enter the Kanchenjunga Conservation Area. Trek through pristine forest.',2995,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(359,48,6,'Tortong to Ramche','Climb into alpine terrain with first views of Kanchenjunga\'s southern aspect.',3724,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(360,48,7,'Ramche to South BC Viewpoint','Trek toward the South Base Camp area for views of the south face.',4200,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(361,48,8,'Kanchenjunga South Base Camp','Reach South Base Camp (4,750m) directly beneath the world\'s 3rd highest peak.',4750,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(362,48,9,'South BC to Ramche','Begin descent and begin the traverse toward North Base Camp.',3724,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(363,48,10,'Ramche to Sele La Base Camp','Climb toward the pass connecting south and north Kanchenjunga valleys.',4290,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(364,48,11,'Cross Sele La, Trek to Tseram','Cross the Sele La pass and descend to Tseram in the Ghunsa Valley.',3870,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(365,48,12,'Tseram to Ghunsa','Descend to Ghunsa — the main village of the north Kanchenjunga approach.',3595,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(366,48,13,'Ghunsa to Lhonak','Ascend through glacial terrain to Lhonak.',4790,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(367,48,14,'Kanchenjunga North Base Camp','Trek to North Base Camp (5,143m) — a dramatic position beneath the north face of Kanchenjunga. Return to Ghunsa.',3595,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(368,48,15,'Ghunsa to Phole','Begin the long return trek.',3210,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(369,48,16,'Phole to Gyabla','Continue descent.',2730,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(370,48,17,'Gyabla to Tapethok','Trek through lower valley toward the road.',1441,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(371,48,18,'Tapethok to Taplejung','Return to Taplejung.',1819,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(372,48,19,'Fly Taplejung to Kathmandu','Return flight to Kathmandu.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(373,48,20,'Kathmandu Rest','Rest day.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(374,48,21,'Buffer Day','Reserve for weather.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(375,48,22,'Departure','Transfer to Tribhuvan International Airport.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(376,24,1,'Fly to Lukla, Trek to Phakding','Mountain flight to Lukla and first steps on the EBC trail to Phakding.',2652,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(377,24,2,'Phakding to Namche Bazaar','Climb to the Sherpa capital through forest and suspension bridges.',3440,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(378,24,3,'Acclimatization — Everest View Hotel','Hike to the Everest View Hotel (3,880m) for the first clear view of Everest. Explore Namche.',3440,1,NULL,NULL,NULL),(379,24,4,'Namche to Khumjung','Visit Khumjung village and its famous yak-scalp school (said to hold a yeti scalp). Views of Everest from this high-altitude village are spectacular.',3790,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(380,24,5,'Khumjung to Monjo','Begin the descent through Namche and down through the forest zones.',2835,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(381,24,6,'Monjo to Lukla, Fly to Kathmandu','Final morning walk to Lukla and the flight back to Kathmandu.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(382,24,7,'Departure or Kathmandu Sightseeing','Free day or transfer to airport.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(383,28,1,'Drive Kathmandu to Pokhara','Drive or fly to Pokhara. Evening preparation.',820,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(384,28,2,'Drive to Kande, Trek to Forest Camp','Drive to Kande trailhead and begin trekking through rhododendron and magnolia forest to Forest Camp.',2520,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(385,28,3,'Forest Camp to Low Camp','Continue climbing through diverse forest. Low Camp sits on an open ridge with first Himalayan views.',2985,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(386,28,4,'Low Camp to High Camp','Trek through the distinctive Mardi Himal high zone — open moorland with extraordinary views of Machhapuchhre and Annapurna South right ahead.',3580,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(387,28,5,'High Camp to Mardi Himal Viewpoint, Descent to Badal Danda','Early morning ascent to the Mardi Himal viewpoint (4,500m) for close-up views of Machhapuchhre\'s west face. Descend all the way to Badal Danda.',2520,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(388,28,6,'Badal Danda to Landruk, Drive to Pokhara','Descend through Gurung villages to Landruk and drive back to Pokhara.',820,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(389,28,7,'Drive Pokhara to Kathmandu or Departure','Return to Kathmandu or depart from Pokhara.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(390,29,1,'Drive to Nayapul, Trek to Tikhedhunga','Drive from Pokhara to Nayapul (1 hour) and begin trekking through Birethanti to Tikhedhunga.',1540,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(391,29,2,'Tikhedhunga to Ghorepani','The classic stone staircase climb through Ulleri and rhododendron forest to Ghorepani ridge village.',2874,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(392,29,3,'Poon Hill Sunrise, Trek to Tadapani','Pre-dawn climb to Poon Hill (3,210m) for the most photographed sunrise in Nepal. Descend through forest to Tadapani.',2630,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(393,29,4,'Tadapani to Ghandruk, Drive to Pokhara','Descend through the largest Gurung village in Nepal and drive to Pokhara.',820,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(394,29,5,'Drive Pokhara to Kathmandu or Departure','Return to Kathmandu.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(395,33,1,'Fly Pokhara to Jomsom','Exciting mountain flight to Jomsom in the Kali Gandaki Valley.',2720,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(396,33,2,'Jomsom to Kagbeni','Trek upriver through the wind-blasted valley to medieval Kagbeni — the gateway to Upper Mustang.',2810,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(397,33,3,'Kagbeni to Chuksang','Enter the Lower Mustang landscape: dramatic red and grey canyon terrain.',2980,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(398,33,4,'Chuksang to Charang','Continue north into the Mustang plateau with its extraordinary colours and ancient cave dwellings.',3260,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(399,33,5,'Charang to Ghami','Trek through the southern Mustang villages with their ancient mani walls and gompas.',3520,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(400,33,6,'Ghami to Jomsom via Marpha','Return south through the apple orchards of Marpha to Jomsom.',2720,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(401,33,7,'Fly Jomsom to Pokhara, Drive or Fly to Kathmandu','Morning mountain flight out. Return to Kathmandu.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(402,38,1,'Drive Kathmandu to Sundarijal, Trek to Chisapani','Drive to Sundarijal on the valley rim and begin trekking through Shivapuri National Park to Chisapani viewpoint.',2215,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(403,38,2,'Chisapani to Kutumsang','Trek along the ridge through traditional Tamang villages with Himalayan views.',2470,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(404,38,3,'Kutumsang to Tharepati','Climb to the Tharepati pass (3,640m) with sweeping panoramas of the Langtang range.',3640,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(405,38,4,'Tharepati to Melamchi Gaon','Descend into the authentic Sherpa heartland of Melamchi.',2530,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(406,38,5,'Melamchi Gaon to Tarkeghyang','Trek to the main Helambu Sherpa village of Tarkeghyang with its ancient monastery.',2470,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(407,38,6,'Tarkeghyang to Sermathang, Drive to Kathmandu','Trek to the road at Sermathang and drive back to Kathmandu.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(408,38,7,'Departure','Transfer to Tribhuvan International Airport.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(409,40,1,'Drive Kathmandu to Tarkughat','Drive northwest to the starting point.',800,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(410,40,2,'Tarkughat to Arughat','Trek through subtropical forest to Arughat on the Budhi Gandaki.',540,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(411,40,3,'Arughat to Singla Bazar','Climb into the Ganesh Himal foothills through diverse forest.',1440,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(412,40,4,'Singla Bazar to Sirandanda Ridge','Trek up to the high ridge with panoramic views of Ganesh Himal.',2800,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(413,40,5,'Sirandanda to Lihi','Descend through traditional Tamang and Gurung villages.',2150,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(414,40,6,'Lihi to Laprak','Trek through the ruby-mining region. Visit traditional homes and workshops.',1870,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(415,40,7,'Drive Laprak to Kathmandu','Return drive to Kathmandu.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(416,42,1,'Drive Kathmandu to Syabrubesi','Drive to the Langtang region gateway.',1503,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(417,42,2,'Syabrubesi to Gatlang','Begin the Tamang Heritage Trail through traditional villages. Gatlang is a beautifully preserved Tamang community.',2238,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(418,42,3,'Gatlang to Tatopani','Trek along the Langtang ridge with views of Ganesh Himal. Visit the hot springs at Tatopani.',2607,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(419,42,4,'Tatopani to Thuman','Continue through the cultural heartland of Tamang communities.',2200,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(420,42,5,'Thuman to Briddim','Visit the monastery at Lingling and trek to Briddim — a highlight village of the Tamang trail.',2229,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(421,42,6,'Briddim to Syabrubesi','Return to Syabrubesi completing the trail loop.',1503,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(422,42,7,'Drive Syabrubesi to Kathmandu or Departure','Return drive to Kathmandu.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(423,50,1,'Drive Kathmandu to Phaplu or Salleri','Drive to the Solu Khumbu region in eastern Nepal. Phaplu has a small airstrip as an alternative.',2413,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(424,50,2,'Phaplu to Junbesi','Trek through traditional Sherpa villages in the Solu region — a rich cultural landscape.',2675,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(425,50,3,'Junbesi to Pikey Base Camp','Climb through rhododendron forest to the base camp below Pikey Peak.',3640,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(426,50,4,'Summit Pikey Peak, Trek to Jase Bhanjyang','Pre-dawn ascent to Pikey Peak summit (4,065m). On a clear day: Everest, Makalu, Kanchenjunga, Annapurna, and Dhaulagiri are all visible simultaneously. Descend to Jase Bhanjyang.',2820,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(427,50,5,'Jase Bhanjyang to Salleri','Trek to the district headquarters of Salleri.',2413,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(428,50,6,'Drive Salleri to Kathmandu','Return drive to Kathmandu.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(429,50,7,'Departure','Transfer to Tribhuvan International Airport.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(430,51,1,'Drive to Nayapul, Trek to Tikhedhunga','Drive to Nayapul and begin the classic Annapurna foothills approach.',1540,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(431,51,2,'Tikhedhunga to Ghorepani','Climb through rhododendron forest to the Ghorepani ridge.',2874,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(432,51,3,'Poon Hill Sunrise, Trek to Mohare Danda','Pre-dawn Poon Hill (3,210m) sunrise. Continue along the ridge — away from the mainstream trail — to the Mohare Danda community lodge (3,300m).',3300,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(433,51,4,'Mohare Danda to Nayapul, Drive to Pokhara','Morning views from the ridge, then descend through traditional villages to Nayapul. Drive to Pokhara.',820,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(434,51,5,'Drive Pokhara to Kathmandu or Departure','Return to Kathmandu.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(435,52,1,'Sundarijal to Chisapani','Trek from the Sundarijal reservoir through Shivapuri National Park forest to the ridge-top viewpoint at Chisapani.',2215,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(436,52,2,'Chisapani to Nagarkot','Follow the valley rim east through traditional Newari villages to Nagarkot (2,175m) — one of Nepal\'s finest sunrise viewpoints.',2175,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(437,52,3,'Nagarkot to Dhulikhel','Walk the scenic ridge trail from Nagarkot to Dhulikhel, a traditional Newari hilltop town.',1550,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(438,52,4,'Dhulikhel to Namobuddha to Panauti','Visit the sacred Namobuddha Buddhist stupa and descend to the ancient Newari town of Panauti.',1390,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(439,52,5,'Drive Panauti to Kathmandu or Departure','Drive back to Kathmandu.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(440,53,1,'Drive Kathmandu to Benighat/Dhading','Drive west to the Chepang foothills.',400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(441,53,2,'Trek to Tripureshwor','Begin the trail through tropical forest and Chepang settlements.',700,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(442,53,3,'Tripureshwor to Shaktikhor','Trek to the main Chepang community centre. Overnight homestay with a Chepang family.',600,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(443,53,4,'Shaktikhor Forest and Village','Full day with the community: forest walk, honey hunting demonstrations, traditional food preparation, storytelling. Overnight homestay.',800,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(444,53,5,'Drive Shaktikhor to Kathmandu via Muglin','Return drive to Kathmandu.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(445,54,1,'Pashupatinath and Boudhanath','Morning at Pashupatinath temple complex on the Bagmati river — Nepal\'s most sacred Hindu site. Afternoon at the great Boudhanath Stupa — the beating heart of Tibetan Buddhism in Nepal.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(446,54,2,'Swayambhunath, Kathmandu Durbar Square, Asan','Morning climb to Swayambhunath (Monkey Temple) for city views. Afternoon in Kathmandu Durbar Square and the ancient Asan bazaar.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(447,54,3,'Patan and Departure','Morning in Patan Durbar Square and Patan Museum. Afternoon transfer to airport or free time.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(448,55,1,'Arrive Pokhara, Phewa Lake and Attractions','Arrive Pokhara by flight or drive. Afternoon: Phewa Lake boat ride to the island temple, Davis Falls, and Gupteshwor Cave.',820,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(449,55,2,'Sarangkot Sunrise, Sightseeing','Pre-dawn drive to Sarangkot viewpoint for the full Annapurna range sunrise. World Peace Pagoda hike, International Mountain Museum.',820,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(450,55,3,'Begnas Lake, Depart','Morning visit to peaceful Begnas Lake. Afternoon flight or drive to Kathmandu.',820,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(451,56,1,'Drive or Fly to Chitwan, Jungle Walk','Arrive at the lodge near Chitwan National Park. Afternoon cultural orientation and short jungle walk with naturalist guide.',200,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(452,56,2,'Full Day Jungle Safari','Full day: morning jeep safari in the national park searching for rhino, tiger, leopard, deer, and birds. Canoe ride on the Rapti River for crocodile spotting. Elephant breeding centre visit. Evening Tharu cultural program.',200,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(453,56,3,'Birdwatching, Return to Kathmandu','Early morning birdwatching walk in the buffer zone forest. Drive or fly back to Kathmandu by afternoon.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(454,57,1,'Fly Kathmandu to Jumla','Scenic mountain flight to Jumla in Nepal\'s far west.',2370,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(455,57,2,'Jumla to Rara Lake','Trek through Rara National Park\'s pristine forests to the shores of Rara Lake (2,990m). The approach through pine and oak forest adds to the sense of discovery.',2990,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(456,57,3,'Explore Rara Lake','Full day at the lake — circumambulate the 5km shore trail, birdwatch, relax by the water. The silence and serenity here are unlike anywhere else in Nepal.',2990,1,NULL,NULL,NULL),(457,57,4,'Rara Lake to Jumla','Return trek to Jumla.',2370,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),(458,57,5,'Fly Jumla to Kathmandu or Departure','Morning flight back to Kathmandu.',1400,0,NULL,NULL,NULL);
