 1,600 years of Newari art. Yeti Routes Nepal.',1),(76,1,NULL,NULL,'Chandragiri Hill day tour','chandragiri-hill-day-tour','easy',1,NULL,'Year-round (October to February for clearest views)','mixed','day_trip',5,0,50.00,'USD',NULL,'Cable car ride to panoramic views.','Ride the cable car to the top of Chandragiri for sweeping views of the Himalayas and Kathmandu valley.','[\"Cable car ride to Chandragiri Hill summit (2,551m) above Kathmandu Valley\", \"Breathtaking 360° panorama stretching from Dhaulagiri in the west to Everest in the east\", \"Bhaleshwor Mahadev temple — an ancient Shiva shrine with legends dating to the Mahabharata\", \"Dense Chandragiri forest offering a cool, green escape from the city\", \"Kathmandu Valley birds-eye view with the city\'s full tapestry spread below\", \"Accessible and family-friendly — combine with a half-day Kathmandu tour\"]','[\"Private vehicle and driver\", \"Cable car ticket (return)\", \"Experienced English-speaking guide\", \"Hotel pickup and drop-off in Kathmandu\", \"Bottled water\"]','[\"Meals\", \"Temple donation (nominal)\", \"Personal expenses\", \"Tips for guide and driver\"]',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Chandragiri Hill Cable Car Tour | Kathmandu Panorama | Yeti Routes','Cable car to Chandragiri Hill (2,551m) for sweeping Himalayan panorama from Dhaulagiri to Everest. Ancient Shiva temple, forested summit. Yeti Routes Nepal.',1),(77,10,NULL,NULL,'Paragliding in Pokhara tour','paragliding-in-pokhara-tour','moderate',1,NULL,'Year-round (October to May for best conditions; September for world paragliding events)','mixed','day_trip',5,0,100.00,'USD',NULL,'Fly over Phewa Lake.','Tandem paragliding flight from Sarangkot. One of the best places in the world to experience free flight.','[\"Tandem paragliding from Sarangkot — Nepal\'s premier paragliding launch site with world-class thermals\", \"30 to 45-minute flight over the turquoise waters of Phewa Lake with Annapurna panorama\", \"Machhapuchhre (Fishtail) and the Annapurna range dominate your view throughout the flight\", \"APPI-certified professional pilots with thousands of flights of experience\", \"Smooth and safe tandem flight — no experience required\", \"Optional acrobatic manoeuvres for the adventurous\"]','[\"Tandem paragliding flight (30–45 minutes)\", \"Professional APPI-certified pilot\", \"All paragliding equipment\", \"Transport to Sarangkot launch site and back to Lakeside Pokhara\", \"GoPro in-flight video (standard package)\"]','[\"Transport from Kathmandu to Pokhara\", \"Personal travel insurance (mandatory for adventure activities)\", \"Additional video/photo packages\", \"Tips for pilot\"]',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Paragliding in Pokhara | Sarangkot | 30-45 Min Flight | Yeti Routes','Tandem paragliding from Sarangkot over Phewa Lake with Annapurna panorama. 30-45 min flight, APPI-certified pilots, GoPro video included. Yeti Routes.',1);
